OL,3,GNEWSAAirline collapse still impacts
OL,4,Aislands a year on
OL,5,
OL,6,FJersey's government said more than
OL,7,F#7.3m remains outstanding from loans to
OL,8,FBlue Islands, one year after the
OL,9,Fairline ceased operations.
OL,11,FJersey's Treasury and Exchequer said
OL,12,Fthe outstanding balance stood at
OL,13,F#7,382,822 with "no further funds
OL,14,Freceived" from liquidators since the
OL,15,Fclosure.
OL,17,FThe liquidators, Ernst & Young (EY),
OL,18,Fsaid most of the airline's remaining
OL,19,Fassets had now been sold or converted
OL,20,Finto money, with further payments
OL,21,Fexpected.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
